@page
@model MoneyMate.Pages.Account.RegisterModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "회원가입"; }
<section class="account-wrap">
    <div class="account-intro"><span class="eyebrow">START YOUR RECORD</span><h1>나의 가계부를<br /><span>시작하세요.</span></h1><p>내 계정으로 수입과 지출을 관리할<br />첫 번째 준비를 마칩니다.</p></div>
    <div class="account-card"><h2>회원가입</h2><p class="form-description">이메일과 비밀번호로 계정을 만듭니다.</p>
        <form method="post">
            <div asp-validation-summary="All" class="validation" role="alert"></div>
            <div class="field"><label asp-for="Input.Email">이메일</label><input asp-for="Input.Email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required /></div>
            <div class="field"><label asp-for="Input.DisplayName">이름</label><input asp-for="Input.DisplayName" autocomplete="nickname" maxlength="50" required /></div>
            <div class="field"><label asp-for="Input.Password">비밀번호</label><input asp-for="Input.Password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" maxlength="128" required /><small>8자 이상, 영문 대문자·소문자·숫자를 포함해주세요.</small></div>
            <div class="field"><label asp-for="Input.ConfirmPassword">비밀번호 확인</label><input asp-for="Input.ConfirmPassword" autocomplete="new-password" maxlength="128" required /></div>
            <button class="primary full-width" type="submit">회원가입</button>
        </form>
        <p class="form-switch">이미 계정이 있나요? <a asp-page="/Account/Login">로그인</a></p>
    </div>
</section>
